Chamf3r offline English-Turkish dictionary
==========================================

The bundled word list is derived from the FreeDict English-Turkish
dictionary, version 0.3 (36,589 headwords in the upstream TEI source).

  Source:  https://download.freedict.org/dictionaries/eng-tur/0.3/
  Project: https://freedict.org/
  License: GNU General Public License version 2.0 or later
           (see data/COPYING)

Upstream notes that the lexical data was taken from the GPL program
gtksozluk2 by Mehmet Ali Vardar, then converted to TEI by the FreeDict
project (Michael Bunk, Piotr Bański, Sebastian Humenda, and others).

What Chamf3r changed
--------------------
tools/build_dict.py reads the official eng-tur.tei file and writes a
compact JSON file (data/eng-tur.min.json) for offline lookup. Meanings
are trimmed to short senses; a small set of function words and
contractions is prepended for song-lyric coverage. No FreeDict files
were used except this derived JSON and the accompanying license texts.

To rebuild the JSON from the official source:

  curl -L -o /tmp/freedict-eng-tur-0.3.src.tar.xz \
    https://download.freedict.org/dictionaries/eng-tur/0.3/freedict-eng-tur-0.3.src.tar.xz
  tar -xJf /tmp/freedict-eng-tur-0.3.src.tar.xz
  python3 tools/build_dict.py path/to/eng-tur.tei data/eng-tur.min.json
